===Noun===
{{head|rup|noun|g=n}} (''plural'' '''[[fluiri]]''' / '''[[fluire]]''')

# {{alternative form of|rup|fluiarã}}- [[whistle]]

===Etymology 2===
From the above, given the comparison of a bone to a flute; compare {{cog|ro|fluier}}; cf. also the semantic evolution in Latin {{m|la|tibia}}, which also possessed the sense of "flute".

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|rup|fljer}}, {{l|rup|fler}}, {{l|rup|fljor}}

===Noun===
{{head|rup|noun|g=n}} (''plural'' '''[[fluiri]]''' / '''[[fluire]]''')

# [[tibia]], [[shinbone]]

